OL,5,G0400 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition kicks off at Rob
OL,7,     Fand Jo's dog-friendly B&B in Hope
OL,8,     FMountain in North Wales. But tough
OL,9,     Ffeedback leaves them ready to
OL,10,     Ffight back.
OL,11,G0425 Four in a Bed
